<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Spanish first division after Sunday's games.</p>
<p>14 -  Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>13 -  Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>10 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>9  -  Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao), Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid)</p>
